      "marks_pos": 1.0,
      "marks_neg": 0.25,
      "question": "Select the set whose numbers have the same relationship as the numbers of the set given below.\n\n(9, 41, 169)",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "1",
          "text": "(11, 51, 290)"
        },
        {
          "label": "2",
          "text": "(7, 31, 129)"
        },
        {
          "label": "3",
          "text": "(5, 21, 98)"
        },
        {
          "label": "4",
          "text": "(6, 34, 141)"
        }
      ],
      "correct": "2",
      "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n(9, 41, 169)\n\n(41 - 9) × 5 + 9 = 169\n\n32 × 5 + 9 = 169\n\n160 + 9 = 169\n\n169 = 169 (LHS = RHS) \n\nSimilarly,\n\n(7, 31, 129)\n\n(31 - 7) × 5 + 9 = 129\n\n24 × 5 + 9 = 129\n\n120 + 9 = 129\n\n129 = 129 (LHS = RHS) \n\nHence, **\"Option 2\"** is the correct answer.",
      "tags": [
        "Number Based"
      ]
    },
